{"id":"n30859-1-2","stage":2,"title":"그제 · 前天","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n30859-1-2-1","ko":"그제 무엇을 했나요?","zh":"前天做什么了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그제","meaning":"前天","explanation":"그제：前天。","readings":[{"term":"그제","audio":"/audio/70a7cbc2b8affc5606f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30859","senseId":"1","lemma":"그제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그제","audio":"/audio/70a7cbc2b8affc5606f6.mp3"}},{"text":"무엇을","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무엇：什么；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"무엇","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17199","senseId":"1","lemma":"무엇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무엇을","audio":"/audio/24dedd16c140f1fef242.mp3"}},{"text":"했나요?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했나요","audio":"/audio/1b55d8a68d8d42bb194b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"70a7cbc2b8affc56","term":"그제","zh":"前天","audio":"/audio/70a7cbc2b8affc5606f6.mp3","entryId":"30859","definition":"在昨天的前一天。","pronunciation":["그제"]},{"id":"c95167f3fe21887b","term":"무엇","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3","entryId":"17199","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["무얻"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7b7cc75d98f170e5c286.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n30859-1-2-2","ko":"오랜만에 친구들과 만나서 차를 마셨습니다.","zh":"和好久不见的朋友们见面喝了茶。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오랜만에","meaning":"好久，久违","explanation":"오랜만：好久，久违；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"오랜만","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68090","senseId":